### Ignore Python related files
venv/
__pycache__/

### Ignore auto generated files
node_modules/
*.json
!package.json
!package-lock.json
*.log
logs/
frontend/build/

### Runtime state that has to survive an image pull: the .last-good snapshots and the
### append-only history store. Neither is covered by the wholesale *.json rule above -
### the snapshots end in .last-good, the history in .ndjson - so the directory is ignored
### as a whole. This is also the directory the README tells you to mount.
### Anchored: without the leading slash this would also match frontend/src/data.
/data/

### Agent worktrees. These are checkouts of this very repository, so committing them
### would nest a repo inside itself.
.claude/

.env